[00:00.66]Lesson 103 | 第103课
[00:03.54]The French test | 法语考试
[00:06.77]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.82]How long did the exam last? | 考试持续了多长时间?
[00:17.91]How was the exam, Richard? | 理查德,考试考得怎么样?
[00:20.80]Not too bad. | 还不错。
[00:22.56]I think I passed in English and Mathematics. | 我想我的英语和数学及格了。
[00:27.28]The questions were very easy. | 题目很简单。
[00:30.34]How about you, Gary? | 加里,你呢?
[00:33.99]The English and Maths papers weren't easy enough for me. | 英语和数学卷对我来说不够简单。
[00:39.98]I hope I haven't failed. | 我希望我没有不及格。
[00:42.79]I think I failed the French paper. | 我想我的法语不及格。
[00:46.60]I could answer sixteen of the questions. | 我能回答其中的十六道题。
[00:50.56]They were very easy. | 那些题很简单。
[00:53.03]But I couldn't answer the rest. | 但我答不出剩下的。
[00:56.21]They were too difficult for me. | 那些题对我来说太难了。
[01:00.29]French tests are awful, aren't they? | 法语考试很糟糕,不是吗?
[01:03.85]I hate them. | 我讨厌它们。
[01:05.72]I'm sure I've got a low mark. | 我肯定我得分很低。
[01:10.13]Oh, cheer up! | 哦,振作起来!
[01:12.73]Perhaps we didn't do too badly. | 也许我们考得不太糟。
[01:17.01]The guy next to me wrote his name at the top of the paper. | 我旁边那个家伙把名字写在卷子顶上。
[01:22.53]Yes? | 是吗?
[01:24.11]Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours! | 然后他就坐在那里,盯着卷子看了三个小时!
[01:29.36]He didn't write a word! | 他一个字也没写!